silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_08_sections_02_concrete_anchor_3#retiredtypenode silm:hasLongDescription "The RetiredTypeNode is the type tag for explicit retirement. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'retired', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
